From 054f17094b4d8113bccefd7af28416386f19d654 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lauri Ojansivu <x@xet7.org>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:35:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [WORDPAD][WRITE] Add Finnish (fi-FI) translation

Problem: WordPad and write.exe showed English on a Finnish system.

Why: Both have lang/ files for other languages, but none for Finnish.

How: Add wordpad's lang/fi-FI.rc, translated from the current English
block of wordpad.rc so it has the same MENUEX menus - with the Lists
submenu the older lang files lack - dialogs, strings and accelerators,
and write's lang/Fi.rc; include both under LANGUAGE_FI_FI.
---
 base/applications/wordpad/lang/fi-FI.rc | 342 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 base/applications/wordpad/rsrc.rc       |   3 +
 base/applications/write/lang/Fi.rc      |  26 ++
 base/applications/write/rsrc.rc         |   3 +
 4 files changed, 374 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 base/applications/wordpad/lang/fi-FI.rc
 create mode 100644 base/applications/write/lang/Fi.rc

diff --git a/base/applications/wordpad/lang/fi-FI.rc b/base/applications/wordpad/lang/fi-FI.rc
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..fe6f7219106
--- /dev/null
+++ b/base/applications/wordpad/lang/fi-FI.rc
@@ -0,0 +1,342 @@
