From c724e582e5dbd6e0e21bf357f53bed7eb23c93a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lauri Ojansivu <x@xet7.org>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:38:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [CONHOST][PROGMAN] Add Finnish (fi-FI) translation

Problem: The console host's menus and settings dialogs and Program
Manager were in English on a Finnish system.

Why: conhost.rc and progman's new_resources.rc carry their English
resources themselves and have no lang/ files.

How: Translate conhost.rc's English block and the dialogs, menu,
accelerators and strings of new_resources.rc into lang/fi-FI.rc of
each, with the same ids and controls, and include them under
LANGUAGE_FI_FI with the UTF-8 code page.
---
 base/shell/progman/lang/fi-FI.rc  | 240 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 base/shell/progman/progman.rc     |   5 +
 base/system/conhost/conhost.rc    |   5 +
 base/system/conhost/lang/fi-FI.rc |  96 ++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 346 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 base/shell/progman/lang/fi-FI.rc
 create mode 100644 base/system/conhost/lang/fi-FI.rc

